# What each part of the tree is:
# - Tiles drawn in the decode worker through src/tile.ts: tile.ts holds renderTile, solveLift, scaleLift, measureFrame, coolContent, isOneBand, freshBaseline, bringLensTo, lensForSource and srcFlatOf, all moved out of main.ts so the worker can import them. decode.worker.ts takes a tile job and encodes the JPEG with OffscreenCanvas. decodeClient.ts adds tileOffThread and the flag that sends tiles back to the page where the browser will not encode in a worker. main.ts replaces makeThumb's body with tileInputsFor, drawTileHere and drawTileTimed, and oneThumbnail asks the decode lane first and draws on the page only when the lane returns null. pipeline.ts gains cloneParams (89 lines added, none removed), moved from main.ts because a worker cannot import main.ts.
# - The open photograph taking the worker's selection: decodeClient.ts keeps the 1024 px copy and answers per turn (askFirstSelection, skySelectionAt, canAskSkyAt, requestSkySelectionAt). main.ts seekSky, adoptSky, adoptSkyHere, skyLanded, liftSkyMask and resolveLiftWithSky replace the page-side build in showDecoded and followSkyTurn, with the page's own build kept only where the worker answers null or cannot be asked.
# - The report's new parts: diagnostic.ts tileLine and LastTile; main.ts SkyProfile, liftClock, the Last strip tile line and the sky part of switchSplit; tools/switch-instrument-walk.mjs checks 10 to 21 and the --plant-sky arm, which hold those lines to a clock other than their own.
# - The camera-JPEG selection fix: skyfine.ts stops flagging an 8-bit source's 255s as clipped when it builds the selection's balance, and the comments say why. A raw's copy is unchanged.
# - The slider-at-its-own-value fix: tile.ts snapGain, snapExposure, snapLift and the shared track (trackPos, trackVal) put written values on the sliders' grid; main.ts applyLook writes the balance and exposure through them, and toPos and fromPos delegate to the shared track.
# - The Reset lift fix: main.ts liftOwed, oweLift, holdBaselineSky and the hook in activateCurrent give the Reset target the lift solved with the sky, and the five places that clear liveEdits (openSingle, resetSessionState, resumeSession, showLoneWithEdit, loadGalleryPhoto) also clear liftOwed.
